  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "A sodium street lamp gives orange light, about 1800\u20132200 K. Its glass is an emissive surface far above the Bloom Threshold, so it blooms. The light on the road is a Spot Light with a wide cone, aimed down, with a soft edge. It casts the shadows of the post and of people.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: References 22, 25 \xB7 Lights 2 and 3</color></size>"
