  m_text: "A lit window shows a room behind the glass. Here the room is drawn by a shader (Interior-Rooms), with no room built behind it. The light that falls out onto the pavement comes from a Spot Light inside, with shadows, so the window frame cuts its patch.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: References 26, 29 \xB7 Lights 4</color></size>"
