  m_text: "A fluorescent tube gives cold white light, about 5000\u20136500 K. Its glass is an emissive surface above the Bloom Threshold. URP has no real-time light shaped like a tube, so the light it gives is a Point Light placed just under the tube.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Reference 26 \xB7 Lights 3</color></size>"
