  m_text: "Neon is a thin glass tube of strong colour. Its emission is far above the Bloom Threshold, so it glows, but it lights almost nothing around it. A weak Point Light of the same colour, without shadows, gives the coloured light on the wall and the ground.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Reference 29 \xB7 Lights 9</color></size>"
