  m_text: "Moonlight is a Directional Light: it has a direction and no position. It is weak and a little blue, so the shapes stay readable in the dark. It has no fixture in the picture: it is a hidden light. The whole of this scene is lit by it; it is the Sun Source.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Lights 1 \xB7 Environment, Sky-Room 2 \xB7 The sun</color></size>"
